# Task 147-014 Execution Plan

## Approach
1. Create `src/cli/commands/nervous.ts` — register commander.js subcommands (ADR-012 pattern)
2. Register in `src/cli/index.ts` via `registerNervous(program)`
3. Create `tests/cli/nervous-command.test.ts` — 10 test cases

## Files to Modify
- src/cli/commands/nervous.ts (NEW ~500 LoC)
- src/cli/index.ts (add import + register call)
- tests/cli/nervous-command.test.ts (NEW ~300 LoC)

## Dependencies Used
- src/nervous/executor.ts (Executor class, resolveApproval)
- src/nervous/history.ts (NervousHistory class, readAll, findRecentReversible)
- src/core/nervous-types.ts (NervousNotification, ExecutionRecord, NervousSystemConfig)

## Design
- Commander.js `program.command('nervous')` with subcommands
- Dashboard: read pending from executor, recent from history, config from config.json
- accept/reject: call executor.resolveApproval
- history: read from NervousHistory with limit/since filters
- log --follow: tail -f style with fs.watch on history JSONL
- Colors: ANSI escape codes (no chalk per ADR-010)
